se help  making yearly time lapses you can also  find that on the website  the main reason for that is that there's  going to be a lot of progress and a lot  of development here on project camp but  it's long term it's going to take a  while  and we use time lapses a lot but usually  they last like what an hour two hours  very short and here we would really need  a yearly time lapse which means a  picture every day  so for that you need to have a bit of a  different configuration and setup  we now have a few cameras we can play  with but i'm not sure how to do it  so if you have suggestions uh you can go  to the discord  or uh sign up on support.projectcom.com  if you want to  come here set it up and really start  making these timelapses anyway thank you  guys all for watching it's really cool  to have this community helping out  around the whole project still small  it's growing  but already super cool to receive some  of your old cameras  which are still very useful for us so  yeah thanks a lot  and see you in the next video

